# Android SDK packages installed on Blox workstations (BKW-89).
# Versions must stay in sync with app/gradle/libs.versions.toml
# (android-build-tools, android-ndk, android-sdk-compile) and
# .github/actions/android-sdk/action.yml.
platform-tools
build-tools;35.0.0
platforms;android-35
ndk;25.2.9519653
emulator
# API 35 google_apis image: the primary verification image (BKW-106). Reports
# Build.MODEL sdk_gphone64_x86_64, which passes the app's isEmulator heuristic
# so Local F8e resolves to 10.0.2.2 natively (no adb reverse needed). Also
# matches the Trailblaze CI emulator configuration and is the prerequisite for
# Google-account-dependent flows (recovery).
system-images;android-35;google_apis;x86_64
# API 29 default x86_64 image: smallest/fastest headless boot, kept as a
# lightweight fallback (--device 29-1080-1920). NOTE: reports Build.MODEL
# "Android SDK built for x86_64", which FAILS the isEmulator heuristic —
# flows against local F8e then need adb reverse (see trails/README.md).
system-images;android-29;default;x86_64
